  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e3af67b841dad488297711edfde8971e, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "T\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p kh\xF4ng lu\u1EADt m\u1EDBi: gi\u1EEF m\u1EDF,
    chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB, \u0111\xF3n r\u1ED3i \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EE1;
    kh\xF4ng bu\u1ED9c x\u1EED l\xFD ba c\u01A1 c\u1EA5u c\xF9ng l\xFAc. B\u1ED1
    tr\xED: P20 + P21 + P19 \u2014 c\u1ED5ng con l\u1EAFc, s\xE2n d\u1EEBng, m\u1ED9t
    c\xFA \u0111\xF3n v\xE0 l\u1ED3ng d\u1EABn v\u1EC1 \u0111\xEDch.\nRecovery: T\u1EEBng
    ch\u1EB7ng c\xF3 s\xE2n thu h\u1ED3i; l\u1ED3ng kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1EA9y bi tr\u1EDF
    l\u1EA1i c\xFA bay; sau c\xFA \u0111\xF3n th\xE0nh c\xF4ng c\xF3 s\xE2n gi\u1EEF
    ti\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED9"
